    "detailed_description": "The AI of Station 13 LAH 13000 is defective and does not accept other forms of life. Run, jump and dodge in this 2D pixel art style precision platformer with<br>side-scrolling to get out safely from the deadly trap that the ship has become.<br><br>\u25a0 Single player space adventure.<br>\u25a0 Limited time to get out of each room.<br>\u25a0 Retrieve the keys and go back to open new doors.<br>\u25a0 Defeat AI-controlled machines.<br>\u25a0 Find the secret capsules scattered throughout Station 13.<br>\u25a0 Get to the evacuation ship to leave Station 13 and return home.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2407460/extras/ddbaea78ea90cbd0ecc4d3fdf71a0845.poster.avif?t=1705678511\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2407460/extras/ddbaea78ea90cbd0ecc4d3fdf71a0845.webm?t=1705678511\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2407460/extras/ddbaea78ea90cbd0ecc4d3fdf71a0845.mp4?t=1705678511\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2407460/extras/93a25d0989d125dfdd9335d048fff713.poster.avif?t=1705678511\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2407460/extras/93a25d0989d125dfdd9335d048fff713.webm?t=1705678511\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2407460/extras/93a25d0989d125dfdd9335d048fff713.mp4?t=1705678511\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2407460/extras/bb1d54cfb7d117bdb8a67d16fb552e19.poster.avif?t=1705678511\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2407460/extras/bb1d54cfb7d117bdb8a67d16fb552e19.webm?t=1705678511\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2407460/extras/bb1d54cfb7d117bdb8a67d16fb552e19.mp4?t=1705678511\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The controls and gameplay are easy to learn: jump, run to get further when jumping, lean on walls to climb and slide. If you die, you quickly respawn to keep moving forward.",
    "about_the_game": "The AI of Station 13 LAH 13000 is defective and does not accept other forms of life. Run, jump and dodge in this 2D pixel art style precision platformer with<br>side-scrolling to get out safely from the deadly trap that the ship has become.<br><br>\u25a0 Single player space adventure.<br>\u25a0 Limited time to get out of each room.<br>\u25a0 Retrieve the keys and go back to open new doors.<br>\u25a0 Defeat AI-controlled machines.<br>\u25a0 Find the secret capsules scattered throughout Station 13.<br>\u25a0 Get to the evacuation ship to leave Station 13 and return home.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2407460/extras/ddbaea78ea90cbd0ecc4d3fdf71a0845.poster.avif?t=1705678511\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2407460/extras/ddbaea78ea90cbd0ecc4d3fdf71a0845.webm?t=1705678511\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2407460/extras/ddbaea78ea90cbd0ecc4d3fdf71a0845.mp4?t=1705678511\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2407460/extras/93a25d0989d125dfdd9335d048fff713.poster.avif?t=1705678511\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2407460/extras/93a25d0989d125dfdd9335d048fff713.webm?t=1705678511\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2407460/extras/93a25d0989d125dfdd9335d048fff713.mp4?t=1705678511\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2407460/extras/bb1d54cfb7d117bdb8a67d16fb552e19.poster.avif?t=1705678511\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2407460/extras/bb1d54cfb7d117bdb8a67d16fb552e19.webm?t=1705678511\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2407460/extras/bb1d54cfb7d117bdb8a67d16fb552e19.mp4?t=1705678511\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The controls and gameplay are easy to learn: jump, run to get further when jumping, lean on walls to climb and slide. If you die, you quickly respawn to keep moving forward.",
